  detail=['From WP-13 (D158): the live terminal\'s WebSocket `GET /_mostra/v/{rev}/term/{session}` is declared and authenticated already: an upgrade needs a single-use socket-purpose ticket from `POST /_mostra/v/{rev}/ticket` (`{ purpose: "socket" }`), checked for its purpose, origin and artifact and spent once, then answers 501 until this package serves it. Serve it behind that check, so terminals work in worker-mode frames (cross-site tunnels), where cookies don\'t reach the frame, and repeat `test/hygiene/checklist.test.ts`\'s socket cases with the real handler.', "PTY host and `pty` port; declared sessions only; WebSocket protocol with backpressure; asciicast v3 tee.", "xterm.js 6 WebGL engine as a first-party embed-engine plugin.", "Ratzilla template and WASM island with frame reporting; zero-cell-difference proof against capture (TM-05).", "`<TerminalCompare>` and cell-rectangle comments.", "The xterm.js engine's contract proof through `mostra plugin verify`, moved here from WP-25 (D122): it is the terminal half of EX-05, which WP-25 closes for v1."],
