  detail=["From WP-14 (D162): the Skill's three examples (`skills/mostra/assets/examples/`) seed the templates and the gallery; when `mostra new --template` exists, the Skill's step 2 and the scaffolded `AGENTS.md` (`packages/runtime/src/publish/scaffold.ts`) name it. Links from the Skill and the plugin's README to docs pages move to the docs site once it is deployed, and the plugin's `homepage` and `documentationUrl` in `tools/plugins/definition.ts` with them (the directory listing shows both).", "Templates per family, one-off and long-lived, each with AGENTS.md and passing verify; they include a team (roster) form and a hosted-sharing example (D121, D116).", "Gallery with prompt, source and result, including the launch demos.", "Docs site built with Mostra, generated references, per-page Markdown, `llms.txt`, deployed to GitHub Pages under `mostra-dev`; it covers remote servers, the relay, teams and the public telemetry event list (D119).", "SPA-mode completeness review (RS-02)."],
